{
  "_id": "cgaCbspiritsfrom",
  "name": "Spirits from Beyond",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/magic/unholy/silhouette-robe-evil-glow.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> When you give Bardic Inspiration, the module offers to channel a random spirit (it rolls your Bardic Inspiration die). <strong>Controlled Channeling</strong> (Bonus Action, spends a Bardic Inspiration use): choose a spirit up to your die's highest number. A spirit stays channeled until you unleash it or finish a rest. <strong>Unleash Spirit</strong> (Magic action, one creature within 30 ft): pick a channeled spirit and the module applies it - Beloved (heal die + CHA), Sharpshooter (Force die + CHA), Avenger (melee attackers take Force die), Renegade (target teleports 30 ft), Fortune Teller (Advantage on D20 Tests), Wayfarer (temp HP die + Bard level, +10 ft Speed), Trickster (WIS save, 2 dice Psychic + Charmed), Shade (Invisible, then a CON save burst of 2 dice Necrotic), Arsonist (DEX save, 4 dice Fire), Coward (WIS save in 30 ft or Frightened), Brute (STR save in 30 ft, 3 dice Thunder + Prone), Priest (heal 2 dice and end a condition).</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
